  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180 °C and line an 18 cm springform tin.",
    "Blend the pistachios to a fine crumb and set aside.",
    "Blend the eggs and cottage cheese until smooth, then whisk in the sugars, vanilla, oil and pistachios.",
    "Sift the flour, baking powder, baking soda, salt and matcha and fold into the wet mixture.",
    "Pack the blackberries tightly into the bottom of the tin and pour the batter on top.",
    "Bake about 50 minutes, until a tester comes out clean. Cool, then turn upside down.",
    "Compote: cook the blackberries, lemon juice and sugar until bubbling, add the cornstarch slurry and simmer a few minutes to thicken. Serve with the cake, yogurt and chopped pistachios."
  ]
